From 0c1e89d4e1388f683faa3df2922dcfd2136080a5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Flytiger Eco <dev@flytiger-eco.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 19:55:03 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] feat(sdpa): add the FA3 flex flash attention SDPA
 backend, benchmarks and tests

Add the flex flash attention (FA3) SDPA backend with runtime env gating
and wire the loader, backend selection and autograd rules into the
v2.14.1 SDPA stack, together with the correctness/performance
benchmarks and the PPU SDPA flex flash attention backend tests.
